Third-party assets

The Lora typeface bundled at
"Calm Control/app/src/main/res/font/lora_variable.ttf" is not covered by the
MIT licence above. It is licensed separately under the SIL Open Font License
1.1, whose full text ships alongside the app at
"Calm Control/app/src/main/assets/licenses/OFL-Lora.txt".

The OFL permits use, modification and redistribution, including inside a
commercial product, but it requires that the font keep its own licence and
that it is never sold on its own. Keep that notice file in place when you fork
or redistribute this project.
